  "question": {
    "text": "If the projection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> is zero. Then, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> will be",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given here:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;should be perpendicular to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
